- Raw `fetch()` in components → apiUtils
- Class components · hardcoded colors · `mongodb+srv://`
- Store computed values (e.g. `currentAmount`) in DB
- Break `triggerSave` pattern in `edit.js`
- Unstable `key` (index) on rows with add/delete

